-inspired setting. Nothing to worry about - it'll all be over by Christmas.","steam_appid":869350,"support_info":{"email":"studioelfriede@gmail.com","url":"https://becausewerehere.tumblr.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://becausewerehere.tumblr.com"}